{"resource":"lines/athletic-secretary","about":"One budget line, every year and stage a document states it.","count":12,"caveats":["A STAGE IS NOT A PERIOD. There is no join between this table and `ledger_snapshot` and nothing should invent one.","An \"actual\" here is a RESTATEMENT: a prior year re-presented by the people who spent it, inside the argument for the next budget. It is not a ledger figure.","These lines do NOT sum back to the district totals -- between 0.1% and 1.6% out. Never apportion a total across them.","`documents_disagree` marks a figure two documents state differently. The documents disagree with themselves by up to 1.5%, which is larger than most variances anybody wants to measure.","FY2021 is unusable: 117 of 120 lines print the budget under an \"actual\" heading. Exclude it."],"provenance":{"documents":[{"doc_id":"sources/district-budget-page/text/final-budget-document.txt","path":"sources/district-budget-page/text/final-budget-document.txt","basis":"both","url":null,"copy_state":null,"sha256":"388c1e9d5a01a2556a658750b46b8a0e00bb8b74a55dea394b15e903fe228fb2","cited_as":"sources/district-budget-page/text/final-budget-document.txt"},{"doc_id":"sources/district-budget-page/text/fy19-proposed-athletics-budget.txt","path":"sources/district-budget-page/text/fy19-proposed-athletics-budget.txt","basis":"both","url":null,"copy_state":null,"sha256":"4c69b32bb83088c93380cbfb2b454ad5d638f2a9f3f77a5b359c97c9d32c3c16","cited_as":"sources/district-budget-page/text/fy19-proposed-athletics-budget.txt"},{"doc_id":"sources/district-budget-page/text/fy27-budget-projections-as-of-2-16-26-with-restorations.txt","path":"sources/district-budget-page/text/fy27-budget-projections-as-of-2-16-26-with-restorations.txt","basis":"budget","url":null,"copy_state":null,"sha256":"660dcd34ee636544d3817262e57e2099102abe99479ba45bff69a45da868dff5","cited_as":"sources/district-budget-page/text/fy27-budget-projections-as-of-2-16-26-with-restorations.txt"},{"doc_id":"sources/distr